<fragment mode="section" requested-start="doxcnzjawl5gscmN5ONmVcTtq8e"><h2 id="doxcnzjawl5gscmN5ONmVcTtq8e" seq="auto" seq-marker="5.8">我的订单与发货</h2><p id="doxcnU9elMLCWNavGctfV1psZUg">对应 PRD 3.1.7、3.2.5、3.2.6。</p><h3 id="doxcnrWATwsUwlszJz5yOwNNmTg" seq="auto" seq-marker="5.8.1">用户端与管理端页面</h3><grid id="doxcnlthJUT6uipoTWdhChLBVJd"><column id="doxcntWZsUm7ILcyIX3dcOhW1Jg" width-ratio="0.500000"><p id="doxcnbOt90S2dmuU0TFF6t2ODGf"><b>用户端页面：</b>“我的订单”支持按状态筛选。订单详情展示成交商品、收货地址、当前订单状态和发货信息。</p><p id="doxcnkq16gggS1hOER5tjF7Jbje"><b>管理端入口：</b>管理员在订单列表和详情中查看订单快照、处理订单并录入发货信息。</p></column><column id="doxcnELBzzbrS0wiMAh7r5oypgf" width-ratio="0.500000"><img id="doxcnAEGRMTn5eEiFYlSopwfOsn" name="test.jpg" caption="PRD：我的订单与状态筛选&#xA;" mime="image/jpeg" scale="0.486956" src="Ik42bdzOxo2XPqx33mDc3vaGngf"/></column></grid><h3 id="doxcnyPJLFEk1pQ72m3mUK3XBrb" seq="auto" seq-marker="5.8.2">订单查询与发货接口</h3><whiteboard id="doxcn30PuvQDaB0Rdy7E4MctdPe" token="BHiBwzV9dhIzPhbtyJGctNWdnKd" type="mermaid">sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant A as 商家 Web 管理端
    participant B as 业务普通云函数
    participant D as CloudBase MySQL
    participant U as 用户小程序
    A-&gt;&gt;B: 已登录提交备货完成或发货
    B-&gt;&gt;D: 校验管理员及订单付款、前置状态
    B-&gt;&gt;D: 更新 orders.status 与一组运单字段
    B--&gt;&gt;A: 返回处理结果
    U-&gt;&gt;B: 查询本人订单详情/物流信息
    B-&gt;&gt;D: orders + order_items 成交快照
    D--&gt;&gt;B: 状态、carrier_name、tracking_no、shipped_at
    B--&gt;&gt;U: 展示同一订单的发货信息
    Note over B,U: 外部运输轨迹接口待确认，不冒充已实现</whiteboard><h4 id="doxcnrb0ed2vLnuPovU8lxc87zb" seq="auto" seq-marker="5.8.2.1">接口清单</h4><table id="doxcnpGEEij33JsiK1eR4iADlre"><colgroup><col/><col/><col/></colgroup><thead><tr><th vertical-align="top"><p id="doxcnp77HSr51LdA5TXQDid6C6b">云函数与 action</p></th><th vertical-align="top"><p id="doxcnzrBBZgnAs3Yt3MRpj4Wtig">调用方与身份</p></th><th vertical-align="top"><p id="doxcneRUh1yS64FG1Qv1qNYq18f">用途</p></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td vertical-align="top"><p id="doxcnRT4JokZ8WKE26IdDAyoGlf">business-api<br/>listMyOrders</p></td><td vertical-align="top"><p id="doxcnKhPYmUvC6rkubeO71HLwgc">用户小程序；可信 OpenID</p></td><td vertical-align="top"><p id="doxcnL2FyktsKtd8nXjBtnDFnfv">按状态分页读取本人订单摘要。</p></td></tr><tr><td vertical-align="top"><p id="doxcnpzwUMHwuEXeSSYBOOy4ulc">business-api<br/>getMyOrderDetail</p></td><td vertical-align="top"><p id="doxcnZsRXP1v5Mvua0z40gbjoQc">用户小程序；可信 OpenID</p></td><td vertical-align="top"><p id="doxcnfkYlnY3ffPEQ6H4sJKvsae">读取本人订单、成交快照、地址快照和发货信息。</p></td></tr><tr><td vertical-align="top"><p id="doxcnd5s5aVkeJ105SJzR6e00Qf">business-api<br/>listAdminOrders</p></td><td vertical-align="top"><p id="doxcnFSscNhzR0c66cjDi5T097e">商家 Web 管理端；认证 UID + 白名单</p></td><td vertical-align="top"><p id="doxcn0cFaFOKX4ZnMnHgRZN4oWc">按状态、订单号和时间范围分页查询订单。</p></td></tr><tr><td vertical-align="top"><p id="doxcnwDz36eyqE1NNyh9wxBIZgB">business-api<br/>shipOrder</p></td><td vertical-align="top"><p id="doxcn6qlATjH0wax3iAxeZ5Ugsg">商家 Web 管理端；认证 UID + 白名单</p></td><td vertical-align="top"><p id="doxcnMVvOaNWlwHBqZh4DtqM6Ic">录入一组运单信息并把已付款订单推进到 SHIPPED。</p></td></tr></tbody></table><p id="doxcn6X1gjlN2GLzTI7ykdBTc8c"><b>代码映射</b></p><table id="doxcnKXdVvuucM0L7E8qRRw0bSd"><colgroup><col/><col/><col/><col/><col/></colgroup><thead><tr><th vertical-align="top"><p id="doxcnBCIAHZpegYK63fCZhh6jRe">action</p></th><th vertical-align="top"><p id="doxcnsALmxGcfpapFI9neZAhZ6b">Handler</p></th><th vertical-align="top"><p id="doxcn4akARDqMzqffoumix7MvIe">Service 方法</p></th><th vertical-align="top"><p id="doxcn8INKUN5ajkJYvTqAVWAfTb">事务</p></th><th vertical-align="top"><p id="doxcn8MCP7e8G0cWBr4bYqAN31d">DAO</p></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td vertical-align="top"><p id="doxcnvvkH4VUHXEfwVY6b8yagPg">listMyOrders</p></td><td vertical-align="top"><p id="doxcn9JfJORiIAxsxtkRzIrUxgb">ListMyOrdersHandler</p></td><td vertical-align="top"><p id="doxcnqzhHFfMbnUx24oCApkR5Ic">OrderService.listMyOrders()</p></td><td vertical-align="top"><p id="doxcnAjkeRMOKUtw6YiWGlUn7ad">否</p></td><td vertical-align="top"><p id="doxcnrYxAoMx6hQQHWUNIw9QqJh">OrderDAO、OrderItemDAO</p></td></tr><tr><td vertical-align="top"><p id="doxcnTwqH0H1gTU8ff9JuMU9Fbd">getMyOrderDetail</p></td><td vertical-align="top"><p id="doxcn28CWj7svew2hhh6J79rHDg">GetMyOrderDetailHandler</p></td><td vertical-align="top"><p id="doxcnEpzrL8HyiIkzjRMhwY3jfd">OrderService.getMyOrderDetail()</p></td><td vertical-align="top"><p id="doxcnclgVgndUddNtR2SLK8iFpe">否</p></td><td vertical-align="top"><p id="doxcnWPj0xKsOCCWLj0euhg3rwc">OrderDAO、OrderItemDAO</p></td></tr><tr><td vertical-align="top"><p id="doxcn6BsvT85YruPNPw5FGhEkPb">listAdminOrders</p></td><td vertical-align="top"><p id="doxcnkmRWJyAeMdr1Fz55hWvLWe">ListAdminOrdersHandler</p></td><td vertical-align="top"><p id="doxcnHtVK0dmydTLzpW1NYIkKve">OrderService.listAdminOrders()</p></td><td vertical-align="top"><p id="doxcn2s4wNS2iIksCuGLh4WVEyt">否</p></td><td vertical-align="top"><p id="doxcnkFnUvH6b3aAwqneYHL1jad">AdminDAO、OrderDAO、OrderItemDAO</p></td></tr><tr><td vertical-align="top"><p id="doxcnLt0Rj7HnKLZoo9zgHJsz6f">getAdminOrderDetail</p></td><td vertical-align="top"><p id="doxcn3x9rL3bf3moVtNBL9Mldpd">GetAdminOrderDetailHandler</p></td><td vertical-align="top"><p id="doxcnyOGD6EIc3lu20MnqcBGc0f">OrderService.getAdminOrderDetail()</p></td><td vertical-align="top"><p id="doxcntw9Kk3QAuzgVwqcHh1HSWd">否</p></td><td vertical-align="top"><p id="doxcnbpuwitoH3u04a9OBMyLdtb">AdminDAO、OrderDAO、OrderItemDAO、PaymentDAO、ReservationDAO</p></td></tr><tr><td vertical-align="top"><p id="doxcnm52er0f3LPKry7bdfXaV6b">shipOrder</p></td><td vertical-align="top"><p id="doxcnp6SQOdEZXgBHcd5PVLDO2d">ShipOrderHandler</p></td><td vertical-align="top"><p id="doxcn4wWL2Q8kqfSBihCbFpYYec">OrderService.shipOrder()</p></td><td vertical-align="top"><p id="doxcnqrUP5Z2kKYSsgVjh5W02Hh">是</p></td><td vertical-align="top"><p id="doxcn6ezhb2ekE8NQjHPjAEEM73">AdminDAO、OrderDAO</p></td></tr><tr><td vertical-align="top"><p id="doxcnnUFsDDXoXXxZinXHGqWOZe">completeOrder</p></td><td vertical-align="top"><p id="doxcnlE83rpSAwLB2GgQWtIsrAf">CompleteOrderHandler</p></td><td vertical-align="top"><p id="doxcnlZuX6J7dfnj1ZqyrQJVEcd">OrderService.completeOrder()</p></td><td vertical-align="top"><p id="doxcn5t18VMZFRpZZrahvu2eqne">是</p></td><td vertical-align="top"><p id="doxcnwuo4lwfutzHtpPCZBo0Nfe">AdminDAO、OrderDAO、PointsAccountDAO、PointsLedgerDAO、ReferralRelationDAO</p></td></tr></tbody></table><h4 id="doxcnVSY8JI12SNjIuVHrNcmI3b" seq="auto" seq-marker="5.8.2.2">listMyOrders</h4><pre id="doxcnnHQMKSQAyZcAmCPO9Yyidg" caption="请求&#xA;" lang="json" wrap="false"><code>{<br/>  "action": "listMyOrders",<br/>  "payload": {<br/>    "status": "PENDING_PAYMENT",<br/>    "page_token": null,<br/>    "page_size": 20<br/>  }<br/>}</code></pre><pre id="doxcnrTyYRFJzuFEoBOWCZiZQBb" caption="响应&#xA;" lang="json" wrap="false"><code>{<br/>  "ok": true,<br/>  "code": "OK",<br/>  "data": {<br/>    "orders": [<br/>      {<br/>        "order_no": "O202610070001",<br/>        "status": "PENDING_PAYMENT",<br/>        "total_amount_cent": 12800,<br/>        "payment_deadline_at": "2026-10-07T15:30:00+08:00",<br/>        "item_summary": "白水晶成品手串 × 1",<br/>        "created_at": "2026-10-07T15:15:00+08:00"<br/>      }<br/>    ],<br/>    "next_page_token": null<br/>  }<br/>}</code></pre><p id="doxcnIPt3YhiSaAKQvVmGPUcLEb"><b>查询条件：</b>orders._openid=当前 OpenID、is_deleted=0；status 为空时查询全部用户可见状态，按 created_at DESC、id DESC 分页。item_summary 从未删除 order_items 的成交快照生成。</p><h4 id="doxcn8vQ2oJuRpQlTkvhPFU8x3c" seq="auto" seq-marker="5.8.2.3">getMyOrderDetail</h4><pre id="doxcn14hmJLNTzdrBIhdkVkg4OW" caption="请求&#xA;" lang="json" wrap="false"><code>{<br/>  "action": "getMyOrderDetail",<br/>  "payload": {"order_no": "O202610070001"}<br/>}</code></pre><pre id="doxcnl6nZuA5V2I0SAGPSlIqQQb" caption="响应&#xA;" lang="json" wrap="false"><code>{<br/>  "ok": true,<br/>  "code": "OK",<br/>  "message": "",<br/>  "data": {<br/>    "order_no": "O202610080001",<br/>    "payment_mode": "WECHAT",<br/>    "status": "PENDING_PAYMENT",<br/>    "payment_deadline_at": "2026-10-08T15:35:00+08:00",<br/>    "can_pay": true,<br/>    "goods_amount_cent": 33850,<br/>    "discount_amount_cent": 900,<br/>    "shipping_fee_cent": 800,<br/>    "total_amount_cent": 33750,<br/>    "items": [<br/>      {<br/>        "item_type": "DESIGN",<br/>        "quantity": 1,<br/>        "gross_amount_cent": 33850,<br/>        "discount_amount_cent": 900,<br/>        "line_amount_cent": 32950,<br/>        "item_snapshot": {"name": "绿草莓晶手串"},<br/>        "promotion_snapshot": {<br/>          "sku_coupons": [<br/>            {"sku_id": "001", "free_quantity": 1, "discount_amount_cent": 900}<br/>          ]<br/>        }<br/>      }<br/>    ],<br/>    "address_snapshot": {<br/>      "receiver_name": "张三",<br/>      "phone_masked": "138****0000",<br/>      "full_address": "广东省深圳市南山区示例详细地址"<br/>    },<br/>    "shipping": null<br/>  },<br/>  "request_id": "cloudbase-request-id"<br/>}</code></pre><p id="doxcnu80qkb9QlGJhkmpKVwqRWg">后端处理步骤：查询order_no、_openid=当前OpenID；读取order_items成交快照；从orders返回payment_mode、地址和发货字段。ZERO_PAY订单返回payment_deadline_at=null、can_pay=false；用户接口对电话进行脱敏，不返回支付凭据或管理员信息。</p><p id="doxcn6KKZUeXdcHHCXnXHL0vmHb" text-indent="1"><b>支付按钮：</b>后端只有在 status=PENDING_PAYMENT 且数据库当前时间早于 payment_deadline_at 时返回 can_pay=true。用户小程序收到 payment_deadline_at 后可以倒计时，并在本地时间到达截止时间时立即隐藏或禁用“继续支付”；设备时间只用于界面及时变化，支付 HTTP 云函数仍会再次按数据库时间校验，前端不能单独决定订单是否可支付。</p><h4 id="doxcnqiptCOJI43yaDf5K3UBvxy" seq="auto" seq-marker="5.8.2.4">listAdminOrders</h4><pre id="doxcn8qAWiSM7GkaLGjVnsv5lOa" caption="&#xA;" lang="json" wrap="false"><code>{<br/>  "action": "listAdminOrders",<br/>  "payload": {<br/>    "status": "READY_TO_SHIP",<br/>    "order_no": null,<br/>    "created_from": null,<br/>    "created_to": null,<br/>    "page_token": null,<br/>    "page_size": 20<br/>  }<br/>}</code></pre><pre id="doxcn2wlDsMmKU8Fgei4tFwnKcg" caption="响应&#xA;" lang="json" wrap="false"><code>{<br/>  "ok": true,<br/>  "code": "OK",<br/>  "data": {<br/>    "orders": [<br/>      {<br/>        "order_no": "O202610070001",<br/>        "status": "READY_TO_SHIP",<br/>        "total_amount_cent": 33750,<br/>        "receiver_name": "张三",<br/>        "phone_masked": "138****0000",<br/>        "item_summary": "绿草莓晶手串 × 1",<br/>        "paid_at": "2026-10-07T15:20:00+08:00",<br/>        "created_at": "2026-10-07T15:15:00+08:00"<br/>      }<br/>    ],<br/>    "next_page_token": null<br/>  }<br/>}</code></pre><p id="doxcn3eHLKg2e9dboNOXoOv4lae"><b>后端处理步骤：</b>ListAdminOrdersHandler 从认证上下文取得 UID 并校验筛选参数；OrderService.listAdminOrders() 调用 AdminAccessService.requireEnabledAdmin() 后，由 OrderDAO 组合非空条件查询 orders，按 created_at DESC、id DESC 分页。管理端可读取履约所需完整地址和电话，但日志、列表导出和错误消息不得打印无关敏感信息。</p><p id="doxcnQGQFvwk9AfOQ12dGk5u28H"><b>错误码</b></p><table id="doxcnqSm7IGEAWRrTM5OHG1wmt6"><colgroup><col/><col/></colgroup><thead><tr><th vertical-align="top"><p id="doxcnGXwZASjNorLaqNiVg2n9od">code</p></th><th vertical-align="top"><p id="doxcn6UdMxLGJbWiwIcThc8tkjg">触发条件</p></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td vertical-align="top"><p id="doxcnyhJRQCzpaFSVz6ckLglOHh">NOT_FOUND</p></td><td vertical-align="top"><p id="doxcnZnY5xtnWA70eJnErCdn8me">用户订单不存在或不属于当前 OpenID。</p></td></tr><tr><td vertical-align="top"><p id="doxcnQLKtbSICHaJp3NuMX5dCad">UNAUTHORIZED</p></td><td vertical-align="top"><p id="doxcnxYSld7Co9Atb8jqpCpUb9b">管理端没有有效登录会话。</p></td></tr><tr><td vertical-align="top"><p id="doxcndrTxcPxUeLZ0Gf9pEjjviY">FORBIDDEN</p></td><td vertical-align="top"><p id="doxcnFDy1nRilnVQIuqjAEyosvg">UID 不在有效管理员白名单。</p></td></tr></tbody></table><h4 id="doxcnd25i2w1uxyp43NIDQjwZPg" seq="auto" seq-marker="5.8.2.5">getAdminOrderDetail</h4><pre id="doxcnYUx9SSSK02oWN46N3XR70K" caption="请求&#xA;" lang="json" wrap="false"><code>{<br/>  "action": "getAdminOrderDetail",<br/>  "payload": {"order_no": "O202610070001"}<br/>}</code></pre><pre id="doxcnWCb9XEijOrntHYM3YNQqYS" caption="响应&#xA;" lang="json" wrap="false"><code>{<br/>  "ok": true,<br/>  "code": "OK",<br/>  "data": {<br/>    "order_no": "O202610070001",<br/>    "status": "READY_TO_SHIP",<br/>    "goods_amount_cent": 33850,<br/>    "discount_amount_cent": 900,<br/>    "shipping_fee_cent": 800,<br/>    "total_amount_cent": 33750,<br/>    "payment": {<br/>      "out_trade_no": "O202610070001",<br/>      "transaction_id": "420000000020261007000001",<br/>      "trade_state": "SUCCESS",<br/>      "paid_at": "2026-10-07T15:20:00+08:00"<br/>    },<br/>    "address_snapshot": {<br/>      "receiver_name": "张三",<br/>      "phone": "13800000000",<br/>      "province_code": "440000",<br/>      "full_address": "广东省深圳市南山区示例详细地址"<br/>    },<br/>    "items": [],<br/>    "reservations": []<br/>  }<br/>}</code></pre><p id="doxcnWfPURuK6j80b7xIQWTikTd" text-indent="1">GetAdminOrderDetailHandler 读取可信管理员 UID 并校验请求结构；OrderService.getAdminOrderDetail() 调用 AdminAccessService.requireEnabledAdmin() 后，按 order_no 读取 orders、order_items、payment_records 和 order_stock_reservations。完整电话只用于履约详情，不写日志，不出现在列表响应。</p><p id="doxcnNQj7sDtCal3hka4Uq1jIod"><b>错误码：</b>无有效会话返回 UNAUTHORIZED；不在白名单返回 FORBIDDEN；订单不存在或已删除返回 NOT_FOUND。</p><h3 id="doxcnBMog0NOck4njIiKgJsoysc" seq="auto" seq-marker="5.8.3">发货接口设计</h3><h4 id="doxcnlDQFJKcXzjKLiraHfkK80g" seq="auto" seq-marker="5.8.3.1">shipOrder</h4><p id="doxcnzC0CrFb7omnuulGq40pLLd"><b>请求 JSON</b></p><pre id="doxcnbXKmw3nvjZPiiVR6ORu0yC" caption="&#xA;" lang="json" wrap="false"><code>{<br/>  "action": "shipOrder",<br/>  "payload": {<br/>    "order_no": "O202610070001",<br/>    "carrier_name": "顺丰速运",<br/>    "tracking_no": "SF0000000000"<br/>  }<br/>}</code></pre><p id="doxcnn0OOj5plysoBrvQEfuzb4b"><b>响应 JSON</b></p><pre id="doxcnyGSnRAQAniIQf5Vi66Lf1c" caption="&#xA;" lang="json" wrap="false"><code>{<br/>  "ok": true,<br/>  "code": "OK",<br/>  "data": {<br/>    "order_no": "O202610070001",<br/>    "status": "SHIPPED",<br/>    "carrier_name": "顺丰速运",<br/>    "tracking_no": "SF0000000000",<br/>    "shipped_at": "2026-10-07T18:00:00+08:00"<br/>  }<br/>}</code></pre><p id="doxcnqDvMNttVnEs19HgPYIScjg"><b>后端处理步骤</b></p><ol><li id="doxcnvAEaTVOQ1Ovva2VfOFvQae" seq="1" seq-marker="1. ">ShipOrderHandler 读取可信管理员 UID并校验承运公司、运单号格式；OrderService.shipOrder() 调用 AdminAccessService.requireEnabledAdmin() 校验白名单。</li><li id="doxcntWqMC5ZGqB4ZmXjt5AF0ni" seq-marker="2. ">开启事务并按 order_no 锁定 orders；订单必须未删除。</li><li id="doxcn72vgn2uoY4bTtRcjtumlbg" seq-marker="3. ">status=READY_TO_SHIP 时写 carrier_name、tracking_no、shipped_at，状态改为 SHIPPED。</li><li id="doxcn7FUVTlV9et3EVEUTodVBxd" seq-marker="4. ">status=SHIPPED 且运单字段与请求完全相同时，按幂等请求返回当前结果。</li><li id="doxcn71ZvxdNZ149ElrIuz0DRag" seq-marker="5. ">状态不允许或已用不同运单发货时拒绝，不覆盖原发货结果。</li></ol><p id="doxcnUibOv4JbG2hnI41QgXVlAc"><b>数据库写入</b></p><table id="doxcnGLPHRDehHT7DPA9VE5aake"><colgroup><col/><col/><col/></colgroup><thead><tr><th vertical-align="top"><p id="doxcnynb13VTBgPXztkVs7ja9Fd">数据表</p></th><th vertical-align="top"><p id="doxcnEa59MAIe98yf43cqWiAuac">字段变化</p></th><th vertical-align="top"><p id="doxcnrzcqt5Uy5b3hUv0GsocsKg">事务</p></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td vertical-align="top"><p id="doxcn99pljgu8ZRiFzcshqshNjh">orders</p></td><td vertical-align="top"><p id="doxcnoX6lbFOIxoG5wy7EV0xxLe">status、carrier_name、tracking_no、shipped_at、updated_at。</p></td><td vertical-align="top"><p id="doxcnmPVXQ7XqMMYS6NSZepVRDg">锁定单行后提交。</p></td></tr></tbody></table><p id="doxcnfAWLjGWLupwSpifV3USg3e" text-indent="1">发货不修改 catalog_skus、order_stock_reservations 或 inventory_movements。库存已经在支付成功事务中从预占转为实际售出。</p><p id="doxcnYp6zKQo2IAHtm6jHAGOQog"><b>错误码</b></p><table id="doxcnVTWvrqb75NinpnRgRarh1b"><colgroup><col/><col/></colgroup><thead><tr><th vertical-align="top"><p id="doxcn8ujHgLpeoeJKnOjIdDUJIc">code</p></th><th vertical-align="top"><p id="doxcnd6L3zVqRn8OJlpb1jsPk1g">触发条件</p></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td vertical-align="top"><p id="doxcnTdf58JS7OpzuxkNs0AynCd">NOT_FOUND</p></td><td vertical-align="top"><p id="doxcnanEUA7y0LNWUwna0mVMv1d">订单不存在或已删除。</p></td></tr><tr><td vertical-align="top"><p id="doxcnWSuyG6nBIewa03NFBGvXmb">INVALID_ORDER_STATE</p></td><td vertical-align="top"><p id="doxcnxB8XOTAaWKpPo77Zy7eWXg">订单不是 READY_TO_SHIP，且不满足相同运单幂等返回条件。</p></td></tr><tr><td vertical-align="top"><p id="doxcnTnMQJ9vkxstWK0Ozhv4FYd">SHIPMENT_CONFLICT</p></td><td vertical-align="top"><p id="doxcn6mZvzMVoEWgCJizN5udEig">订单已经用另一组运单信息发货。</p></td></tr></tbody></table><h4 id="doxcnKVFEixK0dKvHRoGpq5zIrg" seq="auto" seq-marker="5.8.3.2">completeOrder</h4><pre id="doxcnjMilhKl20AZVmKW0s8RqCf" caption="请求&#xA;" lang="json" wrap="false"><code>{<br/>  "action": "completeOrder",<br/>  "payload": {"order_no": "O202610070001"}<br/>}</code></pre><pre id="doxcnoBpeJD5IUlXau5Pt1CiKnh" caption="响应&#xA;" lang="json" wrap="false"><code>{<br/>  "ok": true,<br/>  "code": "OK",<br/>  "data": {<br/>    "order_no": "O202610070001",<br/>    "status": "COMPLETED",<br/>    "completed_at": "2026-10-09T13:30:00+08:00",<br/>    "referral_reward_points": 100,<br/>    "idempotent_replay": false<br/>  }<br/>}</code></pre><ol><li id="doxcnNZ8AKw1lAQty7lFPF2mK1b" seq="1" seq-marker="1. ">CompleteOrderHandler 读取可信管理员 UID，校验 order_no 后调用 OrderService.completeOrder()。</li><li id="doxcnkupz1x9ZrJryzTDBXUKhVP" seq-marker="2. ">Service 调用 AdminAccessService.requireEnabledAdmin()，开启 UnitOfWork 并按 order_no 锁定 orders。</li><li id="doxcn9Z9NDi2DxAKfBhINRw3ANc" seq-marker="3. ">只有 SHIPPED 可以转换为 COMPLETED；已经 COMPLETED 时返回当前结果并标记 idempotent_replay=true。</li><li id="doxcnfi8iEuVLGnymogWGkO5OEg" seq-marker="4. ">写 status=COMPLETED、completed_at、updated_at，然后调用 ReferralService.grantFirstCompletedOrderReward()。</li><li id="doxcnCbz2plUFQFOxbR1e6ADmed" seq-marker="5. ">如果这是被分享人的第一笔 COMPLETED 订单且邀请奖励配置大于 0，则锁定分享人积分账户、增加积分、写唯一 event_key 流水并标记 referral_relations 已奖励；配置为 0 时只标记该首单已经处理，不写零积分流水。</li><li id="doxcnZK78oNBoiH886ipPX5wNII" seq-marker="6. ">订单完成和邀请奖励在同一 MySQL 事务中提交；任一步失败全部回滚。</li></ol><p id="doxcn4gjAhhtzVVPNy2IdjV5S6f"><b>错误码：</b>订单不存在返回 NOT_FOUND；状态不是 SHIPPED 或 COMPLETED 返回 INVALID_ORDER_STATE；管理员身份错误返回 UNAUTHORIZED 或 FORBIDDEN。</p><h3 id="doxcnhzSEcjk9FE9aZ31f1YkmWm" seq="auto" seq-marker="5.8.4">用户查看物流</h3><p id="doxcneXKnUwP4lzcUKvOtKrO2Wh" text-indent="1">P0 尚未选定物流轨迹供应商，因此 getMyOrderDetail 只返回商家通过 shipOrder 保存的承运公司、运单号和发货时间，不生成虚假的运输节点。</p><table id="doxcnpdcKLHfu8XGWJry4RdrObg"><colgroup><col/><col/><col/></colgroup><thead><tr><th vertical-align="top"><p id="doxcnQLWGQxZi9dqt0paPtjto8c">阶段</p></th><th vertical-align="top"><p id="doxcn3MQEawHU7BZbPlmMDB5vjg">用户端数据来源</p></th><th vertical-align="top"><p id="doxcnUPhG9H4bPQzNGIAc8XCMei">后端处理</p></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td vertical-align="top"><p id="doxcnQ9VZ9tjHvsqTXqSy3Ujl8E">P0：未接物流 API</p></td><td vertical-align="top"><p id="doxcnrW5y1GpsK7l9msESQmrxhc">orders.carrier_name、tracking_no、shipped_at。</p></td><td vertical-align="top"><p id="doxcnaQfCHSydbitukIpsOjP24q">校验订单属于当前 OpenID 后直接返回。</p></td></tr><tr><td vertical-align="top"><p id="doxcnYelOZUqF15z2Zs3GzZ6aNh">后续：接入物流 API</p></td><td vertical-align="top"><p id="doxcnjOBxF0uoamjFxCKdQc9EUh">外部物流服务返回的轨迹。</p></td><td vertical-align="top"><p id="doxcn33OpV2sfeC817Zbv9pEbrf">仍由业务普通云函数校验订单归属并代查；用户小程序不直接持有供应商密钥。</p></td></tr></tbody></table></fragment>
